From: Sowmiya Sree Elavalagan <ssreeela@codeaurora.org>
Subject: [PATCH] mac80211: Add NSS redirect support

Add NSS Redirect support (nss_virt_if per VAP, RX pushed through the
NSS virtual interface so qca-nss-ecm can accelerate bridged flows).

Originally written for ath10k/ath11k (QSDK), carried by the ipq806x
NSS community builds. Rebased onto backports-6.18.39 (OpenWrt 25.12)
for the Meraki MR52 NSS port: ieee80211_stop() now uses guard(wiphy)
and struct ieee80211_sub_if_data gained tx_handlers_drop, so those two
hunks were re-anchored; no functional change.

